[h1]Friends![/h1]
We just aired another amazing patch for you!
The team worked hard to improve the coop experience, including the Remote Play Together feature.
[h1]Changelog:[/h1]
[list]
[*]The second player can now spawn Devilboy autonomously;
[*]The devilboy now has a protective shell that makes him more resistent;
[*]Devilboy AI improved;
[*]Steamrolling prevention system;
[*]Improved guard system;
[*]Improved performance;
[*]Minor bugfixes.
[/list]
Get your friend to be your Devilboy!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35509179/e31e301f31c0cdb2399cb40be91c4b214217adc6.gif[/img]
